<title>FRANCE: Eridania sole negotiator to buy Kruszwica.</title>
<headline>Eridania sole negotiator to buy Kruszwica.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eridania Beghin-Say has been selected by the Polish government as sole negotiating party to buy seed crushing company Kruszwica, an Eridania spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company, which is situated 200 km northwest of Warsaw and has a capacity of 300,000 tonnes, has been described by Eridania chairman Stefano Meloni as the leading one in the region.</p>
<p>Meloni has also said his company is interested in the deal not just for the Polish market but for export potential to Russia, Belarus and Ukraine.</p>
</text>
